"\"{system_prompt}\" are each substituted with their own argument (never "
"through a shell, so both are always safe regardless of content) — use "
"\"{system_prompt}\" if the tool has its own flag for one (e.g. Claude's --"
"append-system-prompt), otherwise it's prepended into the message "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
